{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/07/01/itm_57c5704ff632d0d7/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.00572","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-07-03T01:21:03Z","content_hash":"0cff6f657892d2cfd834c51d81bbf84d76563ab88f944f02d85aa77452cb2e6d","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.00572"},{"label":"arXiv HTML full text","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2607.00572v1"},{"label":"Official code repository","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/microsoft/HARC"},{"label":"Hugging Face HARC collection","type":"url","url":"https://huggingface.co/microsoft/HARC"}],"external_id":"arxiv:2607.00572v1","fetched_at":"2026-07-03T01:21:03Z","fingerprint":"0cff6f657892d2cfd834c51d81bbf84d76563ab88f944f02d85aa77452cb2e6d","id":"itm_57c5704ff632d0d7","item_id":"itm_57c5704ff632d0d7","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-07-01T07:58:16Z","reading_minutes":18,"score":92,"sort_at":"2026-07-01T07:58:16Z","source_id":"arxiv-harc-2607-00572","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"HARC 研究对齐模型内部如何分别编码 harmfulness 与 refusal，并发现 DAN、PAIR、CodeAttack 等越狱会在 prompt 编码阶段压低其中一类方向，使模型进入顺从轨迹；作者进一步把分析扩展到 response token，发现模型生成有害内容时可能重新识别风险但来不及拒绝。方法上，HARC 用 LoRA 在 prompt 与 response 两侧加入 harmfulness-refusal coupling loss，并用 KL 保持良性能力。实验覆盖 Llama/Qwen 8B、70B/72B 以及多类 baseline；大模型表中 Llama-3.1-70B 平均 ASR 从 0.618 降到 0.064，Qwen2.5-72B 从 0.523 降到 0.148，一般能力均值基本保持，但 CodeAttack 和局部过拒绝仍是主要局限。","tags":["AI安全","安全对齐","越狱鲁棒性","表示干预","LoRA"],"title":"HARC: Coupling Harmfulness and Refusal Directions for Robust Safety Alignment","title_hash":"4140b9c9c799c31c80fed3c484043d7dca72544a9b0f0129111bd03457928521","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.00572"}
